#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:7
msgid "AMD Image Signal Processor (amdisp4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:10
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:12
msgid ""
"This file documents the driver for the AMD ISP4 that is part of AMD Ryzen AI "
"Max 300 Series."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:15
msgid ""
"The driver is located under drivers/media/platform/amd/isp4 and uses the "
"Media-Controller API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:18
msgid ""
"The driver exposes one video capture device to userspace and provide web "
"camera like interface. Internally the video device is connected to the isp4 "
"sub-device responsible for communication with the CCPU FW."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:23
msgid "Topology"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:27
msgid "Diagram of the media pipeline topology"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:33
msgid ""
"The driver has 1 sub-device: Representing isp4 image signal processor. The "
"driver has 1 video device: Capture device for retrieving images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:36
msgid "ISP4 Image Signal Processing Subdevice Node"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:40
msgid ""
"The isp4 is represented as a single V4L2 subdev, the sub-device does not "
"provide interface to the user space. The sub-device is connected to one "
"video node (isp4_capture) with immutable active link. The sub-device "
"represents ISP with connected sensor similar to smart cameras (sensors with "
"integrated ISP). sub-device has only one link to the video device for "
"capturing the frames. The sub-device communicates with CCPU FW for streaming "
"configuration and buffer management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:49
msgid "isp4_capture - Frames Capture Video Node"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../admin-guide/media/amdisp4-1.rst:53
msgid ""
"Isp4_capture is a capture device to capture frames to memory. The entity is "
"connected to isp4 sub-device. The video device provides web camera like "
"interface to userspace. It supports mmap and dma buf types of memory."
msgstr ""

